<title>HONG KONG: Citibank names Asia-Pac private banking head.</title>
<headline>Citibank names Asia-Pac private banking head.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1996-10-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>Citibank Ltd said on Tuesday it had appointed Deepak Sharma as head of private banking for the Aisa-Pacific region, overseeing the bank's private banking business for the whole region.</p>
<p>Sharma, 42, was the head of Citibank private banking for Middle East and North Africa before the current appointment, it said in a statement.</p>
<p>-- Hong Kong Newsroom (852) 2843 6441</p>
</text>
